# PocketBase server URL (no trailing slash).
# Start locally with: npm run pocketbase
#   (binds to 0.0.0.0:8090 so phones on your LAN can connect)
# Admin UI: http://127.0.0.1:8090/_/
#
# Prefer loopback — the app rewrites it to your Metro LAN IP on device/emulator.
# Local / LAN / VPS IP: port 8090 is added automatically when omitted.
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_POCKETBASE_URL=http://192.168.x.x
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_POCKETBASE_URL=http://203.0.113.50
# Production HTTPS (reverse proxy on 443): no port needed.
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_POCKETBASE_URL=https://api.example.com
EXPO_PUBLIC_POCKETBASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8090

# Optional: credentials for npm run pocketbase:seed
# SEED_EMAIL=seed@pocket-habit.local
# SEED_PASSWORD=seedseed123
# SEED_NAME=Seed User

# Restart Metro after changing env vars: npx expo start --clear
